COMMENT    TCRDEna            TCRDna
COMMENT    TCSYEna            TCSYna
COMMENT  Also, strictly speaking, alternate version codes are not defined for
COMMENT  TCROTn (e.g. TCROT9P below), and WCSNna should be TWCSna.  However,
